meta {
  name: Get Profit Loss Report
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/reports/profit-loss?start_date=2026-10-01&end_date=2026-10-31
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  start_date: 2026-10-01
  end_date: 2026-10-31
}

docs {
  # Get Profit Loss Report (Laporan Laba Rugi)
  
  Mendapatkan ringkasan laporan laba rugi keuangan perusahaan yang mencakup:
  1. **Pendapatan Usaha (Revenue)** per kategori produk
  2. **Beban Pokok Penjualan (HPP / COGS)** bahan baku per kategori produk
  3. **Laba Kotor (Gross Profit)** dan margin kotor (%)
  4. **Beban Operasional (Operational Expenses)** per pos kategori biaya
  5. **Laba Bersih (Net Profit)** dan margin bersih (%)
  
  ### Query Parameters:
  - `start_date`: Tanggal awal periode (format YYYY-MM-DD, opsional, default: awal bulan berjalan)
  - `end_date`: Tanggal akhir periode (format YYYY-MM-DD, opsional, default: akhir bulan berjalan)
  
  ### Response Example (OK - 200)
  ```json
  {
    "code": 200,
    "status": "OK",
    "message": "Profit loss report fetched successfully",
    "data": {
      "period": "01/10/2026 s/d 31/10/2026",
      "start_date": "2026-10-01",
      "end_date": "2026-10-31",
      "revenue": {
        "title": "I. Pendapatan Usaha (Revenue)",
        "items": [
          {
            "id": "e0b5f543-0c79-4504-893f-366a5e12ecaa",
            "name": "Penjualan Banner & Spanduk",
            "amount": 54000000,
            "percentage": 37.2
          }
        ],
        "total": 145200000
      },
      "cogs": {
        "title": "II. Beban Pokok Penjualan (HPP / Biaya Bahan Baku)",
        "items": [
          {
            "id": "e0b5f543-0c79-4504-893f-366a5e12ecaa",
            "name": "Bahan Baku Banner & Spanduk",
            "amount": 23020000,
            "percentage": 15.9
          }
        ],
        "total": 71400000
      },
      "gross_profit": {
        "amount": 73800000,
        "margin_percentage": 50.8
      },
      "operational_expenses": {
        "title": "III. Beban Operasional (Operational Expenses)",
        "items": [
          {
            "id": "11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555",
            "name": "Gaji Karyawan & Upah Lembur Operator",
            "amount": 18500000,
            "percentage": 12.7
          }
        ],
        "total": 34500000
      },
      "net_profit": {
        "amount": 39300000,
        "margin_percentage": 27.1,
        "is_profit": true
      }
    }
  }
  ```
}
